flowchart TD
    A[User Requests Item] --> B[Select Request Type]
    B --> C[EIC - Equipment in Circulation]
    B --> D[Distribution - Permanent]
    
    C --> E[Choose Equipment]
    E --> F[Specify Quantity]
    F --> G[Set Return Date]
    G --> H[Submit EIC Request]
    
    D --> I[Choose Distribution Item]
    I --> J[Specify Quantity]
    J --> K[Add Request Note]
    K --> L[Submit Distribution Request]
    
    H --> M[Admin Reviews EIC Request]
    L --> N[Admin Reviews Distribution Request]
    
    M --> O{EIC Request Decision}
    N --> P{Distribution Decision}
    
    O -->|Approve| Q[Schedule Pickup]
    O -->|Reject| R[Notify User - Rejection]
    
    P -->|Approve| S[Schedule Pickup]
    P -->|Reject| T[Notify User - Rejection]
    
    Q --> U[User Picks Up Item]
    S --> V[User Picks Up Item]
    
    U --> W[Item Status: EIC]
    V --> X[Item Status: Distributed]
    
    W --> Y[Monitor Return Date]
    Y --> Z{Returned On Time?}
    Z -->|Yes| AA[Item Status: Available]
    Z -->|No| BB[Item Status: Late Return]
